# Rule: The through-line (`#voidwalker`)

The production surface after the About bio is the ADR-082 U2 HOLOGRAM: a
Tensor-gold figure, era masthead, record/scope panels and six-stop era rail.
"Voidwalker" remains the station title; `.voidwalker*` stays reserved for the
About bio, while this surface uses `.vw*` / `.vwh*`.

**Read first**

- [ADR-082 U2: production hologram stage](../sentinel/decisions/082-voidwalker-character-stage.md)
- [ADR-083: Mobile evidence instruments](../sentinel/decisions/083-mobile-evidence-instruments.md) — proposed phone-only character instrument
